# Copy to `.env` for local use. `.env` is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# CI does NOT read this file. Every secret CI needs is injected from
# GitHub Actions secrets or, preferably, minted on the fly via OIDC trusted publishing
# (see docs/reports/2026-09-14-github-ci-token-injection.md).
#
# The only case where a token is needed locally is the one-time bootstrap publish
# of a brand-new package (npm cannot attach a trusted publisher to a package that
# does not exist yet). Prefer `npm login` (2-hour session) over a stored token.
#
# NPM_TOKEN=
